	<h1>iRGD-Functionalized Phase-Change Liposomal Nanodroplets for Ultrasound Imaging-Guided Chemotherapy and Hypoxia Modulation in Laryngeal Cancer: In vitro and in vivo Evaluation</h1><div class="mobile-social"><button type="button" class="recommend-site btn-native_share d-none" aria-label="Share"><i style="color: #198754" class="fa-solid fa-share-nodes"></i></button>&nbsp;</div><div class="tabs print-hide"><button type="button" class="recommend-site btn-native_share d-none" aria-label="Share"><i style="color: #198754" class="fa-solid fa-share-nodes"></i></button>&nbsp;<ul class="rs_skip"><li class="here"><a href="#"  title="Machine readable">Fulltext</a></li><li class=""><a href="article/metrics/121536"  >Metrics</a></li><li class=""><a href="contact.php?pa=permissions&a_id=121536"  >Get Permission</a></li><li class=""><a href="#"  id="btn-cite_article">Cite this article</a></li></ul></div>
